        <p>theetin„gs held at .Ington, which shos... that the Union is carrying on its work with vigour throughout the two counties. Mr G Whitfield. as delegate to the United Kingdom Band of Hope Autumnal Conference held at Liverpool, read an interesting report of the numerous oonference meetings. The meeting was Inspired with a zeal for work in the coming session which it is hoped will be even more successful than any session in the past, there being great need in this town for increased effort in this work.</p>
