      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-10-26_WidnesExaminer_art0027" n="art0027">
        <head>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN UNION.</p>
        <p>Results of Saturday's Matches.</p>
        <p>NORTHERN RUGBY LEAGUE. G. T. V. i G. a. r Hull Hull Kft 3 ° 12 York Dewsbury 3 7 27 St Helens 1 3 11 Hunslet Warrington 1 2 8 Rochdale II Hudderfield Neigbley 3 3 18 Bramley 1 2 8</p>
