      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-10-26_WidnesExaminer_art0129" n="art0129">
        <head>£l4O FOR HERO'S MEDALS.</head>
        <p>£l4O FOR HERO'S MEDALS.</p>
        <p>Seven medals awarded to Private Wheatley fetched £l4O at Glendinning's on Thursday. They included the Victoria Cross, a medal for distinguished conduct in the Held, and the Legion of Honour. Wheatley belongs to the Rifle Brigade.</p>
